=== push + build in the guest ===
    ⊘ cup8bench.c does NOT include <cuda.h>: it declares the Driver-API entry points it
      uses, so guest and host build it with the same one-line gcc invocation. That is
      what makes the two arms comparable at all.
BENCH_GCC_RC=0
BENCH_GUEST_SRC_MD5=4696109cf0bf64c3bedaf90a9dc13e93

